  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2db70b72201b43c4ca84b5199e6cc4e0, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 27013668864
    m_Localized: <size=28>Dark Lord Declares Princess Abduction in 7 Days
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043028992
    m_Localized: "<size=20>The Dark Lord declared via SNS that they will be \u201Ckidnapping
      the princess a week later.\u201D A photo uploaded alongside the post bears
      the message, \u201Cno one gets to have any fun in my watch, only tedium and
      monotony shall prevail,\u201D fueling the debate."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043028993
    m_Localized: "<size=28>Royal Highness Pledges to Dispatch Holy Warrior to Dark
      Lord\u2019s Castle\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043028994
    m_Localized: "<size=20>The King proclaimed to personally select a holy warrior
      to defeat the lord within the day and dispatch the campaign to the Dark Lord\u2019s
      Castle."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043028995
    m_Localized: "<size=28>Count\u2019s Descendant Chosen as Final Hero Candidate"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043028996
    m_Localized: "<size=20>The descendant of the Count has been selected as the final
      candidate of all warriors. The King gave an explanation, stating, \u201Cover
      a decade ago, the Count mentioned that they are so proud of their firstborn\u2019s
      exceptional swordsmanship.\u201D The hero\u2019s subsequent exploits will be
      published on their personal channel, starting tomorrow, under the title Ventures
      to the Dark Lord\u2019s\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043028997
    m_Localized: "<size=24>[Current Affairs for Dummies] How does the Dark Lord\u2019s
      Castle look from the inside?\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043028998
    m_Localized: '<size=20>Though no one has entered the Dark Lord''s Castle for
      300 years, ancient documents passed down for generations bear the description
      of its structure. The castle is connected to a 5-floor dungeon, each floor
      abundant with monster inhabitants. The first floor has Evil-Eyes, the second
      floor has Murder Mushrooms, the third floor has Goblins, the fourth floor has
      Golems..

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043028999
    m_Localized: "<size=24>Holy Warrior\u2019s Daring Debut! Venture to the Dark
      Lord\u2019s, Ch. 1 \u201CEvil-Eye\u201D OUT NOW!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043029000
    m_Localized: "<size=20>The Holy Warrior conquered the first floor of the dungeon
      within a single day after entry. Our Royal Highness, shedding tears of joy,
      claimed that \u201Cevery townsperson is counting on our hero. May God have
      mercy, save my princess and protect the kingdom.\u201D\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043029001
    m_Localized: '<size=28>[MSN Poll] Nearly 80% of Citizens Say the Princess Gives
      Hope in Life

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043029002
    m_Localized: "<size=20>In a public opinion poll, 80% of citizens agreed that
      the Princess gives hope in life, while nearly 70% agreed that the Princess
      is the future of the nation. Meanwhile, the weekly bestseller list saw entries
      like 50 Reasons Why We Can't Live Without the Princess, \u2026\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043029003
    m_Localized: '<size=28>[Truth or False?] Are Every Fiend Liars?

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043029004
    m_Localized: "<size=20>An old proverb says that eight out of ten words spoken
      by fiends are lies. Is it true? According to statistics from last year, statements
      made by fiends were significantly exaggerated compared to their original intent.
      However, considering the nature of fiends, \u2026\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043029005
    m_Localized: "<size=23>The Taste of Victory! Venture to the Dark Lord\u2019s,
      Ch. 2 \u201CMurder Mushrooms\u201D OUT NOW!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043029006
    m_Localized: "<size=20>After the previous episode, the Holy Warrior conquered
      the dungeon's second floor the very next day. The Holy Warrior, while devouring
      the defeated Murder Mushroom, remarked that it was \u201Cno different than
      fermented mushroom\u201D and that \u201Cthe wobbling legs are especially scrumptious,\u201D
      causing normal mushrooms\u2019 market price to double.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27043029007
    m_Localized: '<size=28>Melted Murder Mushroom: Is it Fermented Food?

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417600
    m_Localized: "<size=20>It is common sense that if food turned blue and mushy
      then it is no longer edible. Yet in the previous episode of Venture to the
      Dark Lord\u2019s, the Holy Warrior consumed the Murder Mushroom without any
      symptoms. Researchers aim to analyze the structure of murder mushrooms to determine
      if they pose no harm to the human body when consumed.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417601
    m_Localized: '<size=28>Why Internet Works Inside the Dungeon

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417602
    m_Localized: "<size=20>This Hero keeps it really HARD INSIDE the dungeon RAW
      upload \u2197\u2197 H0T Live Stream.ing Up to Dungeon Level 2 \u2197\u2197
      Problem with the Internet cutting out from the 3rd dungeon floor? \u2018This\u2019
      will do the trick \u2197\u2197 Holy Warrior VS Dark Lord WINNING Stakes First
      Bet 20%\u2197\u2197 QUIK {W1THDR4W4L} SPEED \u2197\u2197\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417603
    m_Localized: "<size=28>The Unstoppable Hero! Venture to the Dark Lord\u2019s,
      Ch. 3 \u201CGoblins\u201D OUT NOW!\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417604
    m_Localized: "<size=20>The hero conquered the third floor of the dungeon just
      three days after entering. The epic scene where Goblins attacking from blind
      spots were hit by the divine warrior\u2019s smite right through the skull gained
      huge popularity among royal patreons, leading to movements like the formation
      of the Holy Warrior supporters\u2019 group, \u201CHero and the Princesses\u201D.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417605
    m_Localized: "<size=28>Holy Warrior\u2019s Channel Reaches Million Subscribers\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417606
    m_Localized: <size=20>If the hero returns safely, an orichalcum button is to
      be awarded among the honor ceremony.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417607
    m_Localized: '<size=28>Difficult Language of the MZ Generation... 5 Essential
      Terms for Communication

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417608
    m_Localized: '<size=20>The MZ (Magic-Z) generation differs from previous generations,
      tending to use magic incantations silently or as abbreviations and slang. First
      essential term: Mind Reading. By directly confirming the MZ generation''s thoughts,
      unnecessary misunderstandings can be reduced significantly.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417609
    m_Localized: <size=28>Dark Lord Leaves Voice Message To Holy Warrior
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417610
    m_Localized: "<size=20>Analysis of the screeching sound via MSN suggests the
      following message was conveyed to the Holy Warrior: \u201CThe Warrior would
      have reached my castle today at this pace, yet wishing for them to fight in
      peak condition, I have demolished the stairs to the 5th floor. Rest for one
      day and then ascend immediately.\u201D\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417611
    m_Localized: "<size=24>Warrior's Crushing Blow! Venture to the Dark Lord\u2019s,
      Ch. 4 \u201CGolems\u201D OUT NOW!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417612
    m_Localized: "<size=20>The Holy Warrior\u2019s conquest, currently four days
      long, reached the 4th floor of the dungeon. The defeated Golem is an artificial
      lifeform created by casting a special incantation on boulders, unlike other
      monsters. However, inside the kingdom, only qualified sorcerers are prohibited
      to create such wizardry, so do not let your children try at home.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417613
    m_Localized: <size=24>Is the Holy Warrior a Real Hero? Doubts of Forgery Surfacing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417614
    m_Localized: "<size=20>An anonymous fiend, known as a former soldier of the Demonic
      Army, has sparked controversy by uploading a video titled This So Called Hero
      Is Scamming The Whole Kingdom. The imagery includes contentions such as \u201Csix
      fingers visible while brandishing the sword.\u201D Hero and the Princesses
      have stated that the organization will take strong measures against the allegations
      of spreading false information."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417615
    m_Localized: <size=28>Will the Holy Warrior Truly Become a Hero?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417616
    m_Localized: "<size=20>The contents of the voice message sent by the Dark Lord
      have been revealed to be a fraud, causing great shock. Most citizens only learned
      this after watching the latest video. As the Holy Warrior's final fate remains
      uncertain, much attention is focused on the next upload for Venturing the Dark
      Lord\u2019s."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417617
    m_Localized: "<size=28>Will the Princess Marry the Holy Warrior? \u201CIt Depends
      on the Person\u201D\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417618
    m_Localized: <size=20>Traditionally, a savior of a princess ascends to the position
      of queen or royal consort. However, debate rages over whether this custom should
      apply to modern warriors. Meanwhile, the Holy Warrior has yet to provide an
      explanation since allegations of video manipulation surfaced last month.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417619
    m_Localized: "<size=28>Hero and the Princesses \u2013 Name Change Looming"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27051417620
    m_Localized: "<size=20>The warrior supporters\u2019 group, Hero and the Princesses,
      faces a potential name change. The court stated the name \u201CHero and the
      Princesses\u201D could cause social confusion, making it subject to punishment.
      Proposed alternatives under discussion so far are \u201CHero and the Bootlickers.\u201D\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
